# Diorite (Pebble 2) gets the sub-menu settings tree but has no accent
# colour, so it takes the first three shots of the colour tour and no fourth.
# The settings cursor parks on the Timer row -- the last row it has -- to
# mirror where the colour platforms park on Accent Color.

wait 4              # the app's first window needs to be up before presses land
press select        # off hours
press up 1          # one minute
press select        # off minutes
press select        # confirm -- detail opens, not started
press back          # menu, cursor on the timer row
shot list           # the main list, 1:00 selected
press select        # open the timer
fasttick 12:33:42 select detail   # live 0:42 in one session (see readme-tour.scene)
press select        # freeze the 0:42 (or dismiss if the island slipped)
press back          # menu
press down          # to the cog row
press select        # Settings
press down 1        # to the Timer group row
shot settings       # the settings menu with a row selected
